<h2 style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; color: #2a2050; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;">Email Throttle Warning</h2>

<p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; color: #2a2050;">The IDP application is approaching the daily email sending limit.</p>

<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="border-collapse: collapse; margin: 1em 0; width: 100%;">
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 0.5em; font-weight: bold; color: #2a2050;">Date:</td>
    <td style="padding: 0.5em; color: #2a2050;"><%= @date %></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 0.5em; font-weight: bold; color: #2a2050;">Emails sent:</td>
    <td style="padding: 0.5em; color: #2a2050;"><%= @count %></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 0.5em; font-weight: bold; color: #2a2050;">Daily limit:</td>
    <td style="padding: 0.5em; color: #2a2050;"><%= @limit %></td>
  </tr>
  <tr style="background-color: #fdf1da;">
    <td style="padding: 0.5em; font-weight: bold; color: #92400e;">Remaining:</td>
    <td style="padding: 0.5em; color: #92400e;"><strong><%= @remaining %> emails</strong></td>
  </tr>
</table>

<p style="background-color: #fdf1da; border-left: 4px solid #d97706; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; padding: 1em; margin: 1em 0; color: #92400e;">
  <strong>Action required:</strong> The application will automatically stop sending emails once the limit is reached.
  Monitor email volume to ensure critical emails can be sent.
</p>
